@startuml system-workflow
title Solvay Spark Spine AI — Workflow (every flow, from a new document to answers, analyses and Cypher)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam ArrowFontColor #333333
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF7E0
skinparam NoteBorderColor #E0C46C

actor "Analyst" as User
participant "Web UI" as UI #E8F5E9
participant "FastAPI\n+ Guardrails" as API #E3F2FD
participant "Ingestion\n(Docling · OCR · CV)" as Ing #FFF3E0
participant "RAG system\n(rag.py · Ollama bge-m3)" as RAG #F3E5F5
database "PostgreSQL\n+ pgvector" as PG #ECEFF1
participant "Knowledge graph\n(knowledge_graph.py\n· kg_nl2cypher)" as KG #E8F5E9
database "Neo4j 5\nCommunity" as Neo #ECEFF1
participant "Ragas\nevaluation" as Ragas #E3F2FD
participant "Agents\n(Evidence · InsightLens\n· Fit-Gap Copilot)" as Agent #FFF3E0
participant "Hindsight\n(agent memory)" as Mem #F3E5F5
boundary "Anthropic Claude" as Claude #ECEFF1
boundary "Langfuse Cloud" as LF #ECEFF1

== 1 — Upload and convert ==
User -> UI : drop a document (deck · spec · sheet · PDF · e-mail)
UI -> API : POST /api/upload, /api/convert/{id}
API -> Ing : convert(source)
Ing -> Ing : Docling → Markdown; OCR / CV read the pictures
Ing --> API : **Markdown**
API --> UI : Markdown beside the page preview

== 2 — Chunk, embed, store ==
User -> UI : Add to knowledge base
UI -> API : POST /api/docs/{id}/embed
API -> RAG : index_path(knowledge_base/<name>.md)
RAG -> RAG : heading-aware **chunks**;\nembed with bge-m3 on localhost
RAG -> PG : rag_chunks — vectors (HNSW) + full text (GIN)

== 3 — Build the knowledge graph, load Neo4j ==
User -> UI : Rescan graph
UI -> API : POST /api/graph/rebuild
API -> KG : extract_graph(force=True)
KG -> KG : regex + ontology over **every Markdown file**
KG -> PG : read rag_chunks (passage layer)
KG -> KG : write **knowledge_graph.json**
KG -> Neo : load the build whole (background)

== 4 — Ask RAG, then Ragas scores the answer ==
User -> UI : question on the Ask page
UI -> API : POST /api/ask (SSE)
API -> RAG : ask_events — scope check first
RAG -> PG : vector kNN + BM25 → RRF → top-k chunks
PG --> RAG : **retrieved chunks**
RAG -> Claude : numbered excerpts + question
Claude --> RAG : cited answer, streamed
RAG --> UI : SSE tokens + sources
RAG -> LF : trace answer-question
API -> Ragas : judge in the background
Ragas -> Claude : nine judges (faithfulness, relevance, …)
Ragas -> PG : scores on the Ask run
Ragas -> LF : scores on the answer's trace

== 5 — Evidence Agent: RAG + graph + memory ==
User -> UI : question on the Evidence Agent page
UI -> API : POST /api/evidence/ask (SSE)
API -> Agent : scope check passed → investigate
Agent -> Mem : recall (orient, **not evidence**)
Agent -> Claude : question + tools + memory note
Claude --> Agent : tool calls
Agent -> RAG : search_corpus
Agent -> KG : graph_enumerate · graph_path (in-process)
Claude --> Agent : claims + verbatim quotes
Agent -> Agent : verify quotes · compute **scores**
Agent -> PG : store run
Agent -> Mem : retain **verified claims only**
Mem -> Claude : fact extraction
Agent -> LF : trace + agent scores
Agent --> UI : **claims** with sources and scores

== 6 — InsightLens: a BPML scope into a fit-gap register ==
User -> UI : pick a BPML scope
UI -> API : POST /api/fitgap/run (SSE)
API -> Agent : one bounded run per BPML step
Agent -> Claude : classify the step (tool-use loop)
Agent -> RAG : search_corpus
Agent -> KG : graph tools · BPML hierarchy
Agent -> Agent : verifier; synthesis → **reuse %, gap register,**\n**decision pack, workshop agenda**
Agent -> PG : store run
Agent -> LF : trace
Agent --> UI : register fills in, step by step

== 7 — Fit-Gap Copilot: a country As-Is vs the Global Template ==
User -> UI : attach the country As-Is (role-tagged)
UI -> API : POST /api/uploads
API -> Ing : convert
API -> RAG : index into **docling_session** (isolated)
RAG -> PG : session schema u_<id>
User -> UI : run the analysis
UI -> API : POST /api/rollout/run (SSE)
API -> Agent : pass 1 — read the As-Is only
Agent -> Claude : read_sources → **As-Is model**
Agent -> RAG : search the attachment
API -> Agent : pass 2 — compare
Agent -> KG : compare_entities · BPML scope
Agent -> RAG : Global Template + SAP Best Practice
Agent -> Claude : **deviation register** + 0-4 ratings
Agent -> Agent : quality gates repair · **scores computed**
Agent -> PG : store run
Agent -> LF : trace + gate counts
Agent --> UI : register · scores · workshop pack (PDF · Word · Excel)

== 8 — Explore the graph in Neo4j ==
User -> UI : plain-English question in the Cypher view
UI -> API : POST /api/graph/cypher/generate
API -> KG : kg_nl2cypher.generate
KG -> Claude : real schema + values + question
Claude --> KG : **Cypher**
KG -> Neo : EXPLAIN in a read transaction, then run read-only
Neo --> KG : rows with graph ids
KG -> LF : trace graph-nl-to-cypher
KG --> UI : table + highlighted nodes (and Neo4j Browser on :7474)

note across
  Build order: Markdown → RAG index → knowledge graph (which reads the index's chunks) → Neo4j (a copy, loaded whole).
  Claude writes every answer but never searches; retrieval and traversal are the tools' job. The agents traverse
  knowledge_graph.json, not Neo4j. Hindsight orients the Evidence Agent but is never evidence. Every run is kept in
  PostgreSQL and traced in Langfuse; Ragas grades every RAG answer.
end note

@enduml
